{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jousting Manager",
    "steam_appid": 2746150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.poster.avif?t=1724142180\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.webm?t=1724142180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.mp4?t=1724142180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  <br>Welcome to the exciting world of medieval jousting, where you get to be the manager behind a team of knights. Immerse yourself in the medieval era and lead your brave knights to glory through epic and challenging tournaments. Take charge of a jousting team and travel the world, participating in thrilling tournaments. Are you ready to forge your path to greatness?<br><br><strong>Manage the fame:</strong><br><br>Improve relations with the noble houses, allowing you to buy their horses or sign their young squires, who you can train to become knights for your team. While squires, they'll be assigned to a knight, trained with them, and, most importantly, helped dress for tournaments, affecting how well or poorly they perform.<br><br>Gold coins will cover all expenses, including salaries, horse maintenance, facility expansion, and the armory.<br><br>Having the best armor, lances, bows, or saddles will be an ongoing race. All equipment will degrade at the end of each season, forcing teams to build new and better items continually.<br><br>Tournaments will feature five different events, with jousting as the main one. To win, players must choose each pass, the lance to use, speed, where to aim, and the type of strike pose. Pairings will be decided using a Swiss system, and there will be four other events between jousting rounds.<br><br>These include an archery competition, capturing the ring, throwing a wooden plank using lances, and hitting the medieval dummy with enough force to make it spin without getting hit.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.poster.avif?t=1724142180\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.webm?t=1724142180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746150/extras/6b39b7e1e938c385d34e14a3754a9b65.mp4?t=1724142180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  <br>Welcome to the exciting world of medieval jousting, where you get to be the manager behind a team of knights. Immerse yourself in the medieval era and lead your brave knights to glory through epic and challenging tournaments. Take charge of a jousting team and travel the world, participating in thrilling tournaments. Are you ready to forge your path to greatness?<br><br><strong>Manage the fame:</strong><br><br>Improve relations with the noble houses, allowing you to buy their horses or sign their young squires, who you can train to become knights for your team. While squires, they'll be assigned to a knight, trained with them, and, most importantly, helped dress for tournaments, affecting how well or poorly they perform.<br><br>Gold coins will cover all expenses, including salaries, horse maintenance, facility expansion, and the armory.<br><br>Having the best armor, lances, bows, or saddles will be an ongoing race. All equipment will degrade at the end of each season, forcing teams to build new and better items continually.<br><br>Tournaments will feature five different events, with jousting as the main one. To win, players must choose each pass, the lance to use, speed, where to aim, and the type of strike pose. Pairings will be decided using a Swiss system, and there will be four other events between jousting rounds.<br><br>These include an archery competition, capturing the ring, throwing a wooden plank using lances, and hitting the medieval dummy with enough force to make it spin without getting hit.",
    "short_description": "Jousting Manager allows you to play a sports management game from a new angle. Take control of a medieval jousting team and handle all aspects of the club as you compete to reach the top.",
